            "content": "<p><strong>DTF Transfer sizes:</strong></p><ul><li>Adult 10.5-11\" wide or tall, whichever number comes first</li><li>Youth 7.5 - 8\" wide or tall, whichever number comes first</li><li>Toddler 6-6.5\" wide or tall, whichever number comes first</li><li>Pocket/Koozie Size 3.5-4\" wide or tall, whichever number comes first<br/><br/><strong>UV DTF:</strong></li><li>Full Wraps 9-9.5\" inches wide by 3.5-4.0\" inches tall</li><li>Decals are 2.85\"-4\" wide or tall, whichever number comes first<br/></li></ul><p><em>These are approximate sizes and sizing will vary based on design.</em></p>"
